Q: Fatal error: Call to undefined method CI_Controller::CI_Controller() in CodeIgniter controller class extension A: <p>Try this on your controller:</p>

<pre><code>class Hello extends CI_Controller {
    function hello()
    {
        parent::Controller();
    }

    function you()
    {
        $this-&gt;load-&gt;view('you_view');
    }
}
</code></pre>
